'''Snowflakes''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Christmas box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.  

== Appearance ==
It has a dark gray blade with white mini snowflakes varying in sizes on it, hence the name. Its guard is dark gray like the blade and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
It has a [[Snowflakes (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
